      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I encountered something similar if the constraint is moving the head bone. My two headed avatar moves the head bone based on which head is speaking and upon loading in it would move the whole avatar over so that the head bone was aligned w/ my headset but that would unalign the rest of the body. Never checked to see if recalibrating fixed it. I fixed it by just forced the headbone back to the center position on load.",
