      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name} I can confirm its still an issue\n\nI have fixed it on the avatar side if it helps give some insight into where the problem may be.\n\nI have a position constraint on my head that moves it down to the chest as an animation that runs as soon as the avatar loads with no delay. I do this to effect where the voice emits from.\n\nI fixed it by having the animation transition wait for 3 seconds before firing.",
